<title>USA: Microtest names CEO Meise chairman.</title>
<headline>Microtest names CEO Meise chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microtest Inc Wednesday named President and Chief Executive Richard Meise to the post of chairman.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Meise succeeds Roger Ferguson who has been Microtest's chairman since March 1994. Ferguson will remain on the company's board.</p>
